### Quick Reference Commands:

| Command | Hindi/Hinglish Me Matlab |
| --- | --- |
| `pd.read_excel("filename.xlsx")` | `.xlsx` Excel file ko Pandas DataFrame me read karna |
| `df.isnull()` | Dataset me kahan NaN (Null) values hain unhe `True`/`False` me check karna |
| `df['Col'].fillna(0)` | Kisi specific column ke missing values me `0` bharna |
| `df.fillna(df.mean(numeric_only=True))` | Sabhi numeric columns me unka apna Column Mean fill karna |
| `df.apply(lambda row: row.fillna(row.mean()), axis=1)` | Row-wise har row ka mean nikal kar missing value fill karna |
